---
Who is in an organization.

Usage: ink org member <COMMAND>

Commands
  list    The people in an organization
  add     Add a person to an organization
  remove  Remove a person from an organization
  role    Give a member another role

Global  -C, --json, -q, -v, --color, --no-progress, --log, --log-file
        (see `ink --help`)
More    ink org member --help adds examples, notes and exit codes
